        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three <strong>Galacard</strong> games in one package! <strong><i>Galacard: Ackian Archives</i></strong><i> </i>is a collection of modern ports of games from the Galacard series using the original graphics and enhanced music. The games included are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard</strong> (2024) - The basic Galacard experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Platinum</strong> (2024) - Featuring an item shop and a new win system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Advance</strong> (2025) - Includes extra modes and different backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This series takes place in <strong>Planet Ack</strong>, which is inhabited by friendly people called <strong>Ackians</strong>. This small planet's favorite pastime is a traditional card game knows as Galacard, which they always like to teach to those who visit them.  Yes, that includes YOU!. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three games were remade almost from scratch with modern systems in mind, while still retaining most elements from the original releases. <strong>The general rules for Galacard are included in the menu.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three <strong>Galacard</strong> games in one package! <strong><i>Galacard: Ackian Archives</i></strong><i> </i>is a collection of modern ports of games from the Galacard series using the original graphics and enhanced music. The games included are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard</strong> (2024) - The basic Galacard experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Platinum</strong> (2024) - Featuring an item shop and a new win system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galacard Advance</strong> (2025) - Includes extra modes and different backgrounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This series takes place in <strong>Planet Ack</strong>, which is inhabited by friendly people called <strong>Ackians</strong>. This small planet's favorite pastime is a traditional card game knows as Galacard, which they always like to teach to those who visit them.  Yes, that includes YOU!. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All three games were remade almost from scratch with modern systems in mind, while still retaining most elements from the original releases. <strong>The general rules for Galacard are included in the menu.</strong></p>",
